{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y在S01、S05等短时段里未标时出现的感受词仍然偏密，部分心理描写也有补写、加码，X的因果表达更稳、更直接。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y虽然整体信息更密，但重点词放大加亮、话与感受分层，以及感受随音乐到时出现，让观众更容易抓住每段的情绪落点，也更能感受到音乐与人物心理同步变化。它反复发展的水波、小船、摇荡和靠岸意象，把前后段落连成了一条线，细腻度也明显更丰富。不过，X的双栏结构更利于快速扫读，心理因果交代也更完整；Y的优势不是每个方面都胜出，而是整体的音乐体验、叙事锚点和情绪层次更好。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b5ae2b0f-86de-418a-bcbe-2b363ae5e54d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T172244296687Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.0, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T17:23:58.304180+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "37f395191d8b8ae21d65880ae6d31c5b3596f8ff4ee129bd25681673f644e149", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt